  <div class="hw-step__body">
    <h2>Packing it up for a cheap VPS</h2>
    <p>The embedding run produces three files, all hosted on <strong>HuggingFace</strong>. The raw HDF5 is 4.8 GB. A <strong>FAISS IVF-PQ index</strong> compresses each vector from 4096 bytes down to 64 bytes using product quantization, landing at 108 MB that maps into memory via mmap. A <strong>SQLite database</strong> with FTS5 full-text search on titles, overviews, and keywords comes in at 912 MB.</p>
    <div class="hw-files">
      <div class="hw-file"><svg class="hw-file__icon" viewBox="0 0 20 20" width="16" height="16" fill="none"><rect x="4" y="2" width="12" height="16" rx="1" fill="none" stroke="#888" stroke-width="1.2"/><line x1="7" y1="7" x2="13" y2="7" stroke="#888" stroke-width="0.8"/><line x1="7" y1="10" x2="13" y2="10" stroke="#888" stroke-width="0.8"/><line x1="7" y1="13" x2="10" y2="13" stroke="#888" stroke-width="0.8"/></svg><span class="hw-file__name mono">tmdb_qwen06b_1024d.h5</span><span class="hw-file__size mono">4.8 GB</span><span class="hw-file__desc">raw float32 embeddings</span></div>
      <div class="hw-file hw-file--key"><svg class="hw-file__icon" viewBox="0 0 20 20" width="16" height="16" fill="none"><rect x="4" y="2" width="12" height="16" rx="1" fill="none" stroke="#b4ff39" stroke-width="1.2"/><line x1="7" y1="7" x2="13" y2="7" stroke="#b4ff39" stroke-width="0.8"/><line x1="7" y1="10" x2="13" y2="10" stroke="#b4ff39" stroke-width="0.8"/><line x1="7" y1="13" x2="10" y2="13" stroke="#b4ff39" stroke-width="0.8"/></svg><span class="hw-file__name mono">tmdb_qwen06b_1024d.faiss</span><span class="hw-file__size mono">108 MB</span><span class="hw-file__desc">64 bytes per vector, IVF-PQ</span></div>
      <div class="hw-file"><svg class="hw-file__icon" viewBox="0 0 20 20" width="16" height="16" fill="none"><rect x="4" y="2" width="12" height="16" rx="1" fill="none" stroke="#888" stroke-width="1.2"/><line x1="7" y1="7" x2="13" y2="7" stroke="#888" stroke-width="0.8"/><line x1="7" y1="10" x2="13" y2="10" stroke="#888" stroke-width="0.8"/><line x1="7" y1="13" x2="10" y2="13" stroke="#888" stroke-width="0.8"/></svg><span class="hw-file__name mono">tmdb_movies.db</span><span class="hw-file__size mono">912 MB</span><span class="hw-file__desc">SQLite metadata with FTS5</span></div>
    </div>
    <div class="hw-note"><p>Total memory at serving time: under <strong>200 MB</strong>. The FAISS index maps into memory via mmap. SQLite pages get cached in a 50 MB buffer. HDF5 stays on disk and gets read through a 2048-entry LRU cache.</p></div>
